{"h":"\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden\">\n\n<!-- HERO: real video -->\n<div style=\"position: relative; min-height: 820px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #8FC9EE\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"hero-poster.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% 55%\" aria-label=\"Container ship sailing on a sunny blue sea\">\n<source src=\"hero-ship.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.94) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.82) 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 55%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%)\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2; flex: 1; max-width: 1400px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; padding: 92px 32px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 48px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 660px; min-width: 0\">\n<div class=\"rise1\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); color: #0B4F8F; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 24px\">SOUTH ASIA'S CUSTOMS-FIRST FREIGHT FORWARDER</div>\n<h1 class=\"rise2\" style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(52px, 6.6vw, 104px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 24px; color: #0B2A4A\">Smooth sailing<br>for India's trade.</h1>\n<p class=\"rise3\" style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #17436B; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 0 32px\">Customs brokerage, ocean, air and project freight, plus the specialist work few others take on: bonded re-exports to third countries and round-the-clock mobile phone exports from Mumbai. A family business since 1968.</p>\n<div class=\"rise3\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 17px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">Get a quote →</a>\n<a class=\"sun\" href=\"#solutions\" style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; padding: 17px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">Explore solutions</a>\n<a href=\"cbm-calculator.html\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B2A4A; border: 2px solid #FFC93C; padding: 15px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">📦 CBM calculator</a>\n<a href=\"container-load-planner.html\" style=\"background: #0B2A4A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 17px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">🧊 Free 3D load planner <span style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px; margin-left: 4px; vertical-align: 2px\">NEW</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"quote\" class=\"rise3\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(11,42,74,0.18); padding: 22px 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 108%; font-size: 20px\">How can we help?</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #1F8A4C; font-weight: 600\">● Desk online</span>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Service\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px; background: #EEF6FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px; min-width: 0; flex: 0 1 460px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{modes}}\" as=\"m\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"{{m.on}}\" onClick=\"{{m.pick}}\" style=\"{{m.style}}\">{{m.label}}</button>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n<form style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; align-items: end\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{fields}}\" as=\"fd\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873; min-width: 0\">{{fd.label}}<sc-if value=\"{{fd.isSelect}}\"><select name=\"{{fd.name}}\" style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid #C9DCEC; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; min-height: 48px\"><sc-for list=\"{{fd.options}}\" as=\"op\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\"><option>{{op}}</option></sc-for></select></sc-if><sc-if value=\"{{fd.isInput}}\"><input type=\"{{fd.type}}\" name=\"{{fd.name}}\" placeholder=\"{{fd.ph}}\" style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid #C9DCEC; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0\"></sc-if></label>\n</sc-for>\n<button class=\"go\" type=\"button\" onClick=\"{{send}}\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 15px; min-height: 48px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer\">Send to the desk →</button>\n</form>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; margin-top: 10px\">A licensed broker replies within 2 working hours.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ticker -->\n<div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); overflow: hidden; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\">\n<div class=\"track\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{ticker}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"10\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 28px; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 14px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px\">{{t.tag}}</span><span style=\"color: #17436B\">{{t.text}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- NUMBERS -->\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 28px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{stats}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0A6CC2\">{{s.big}}<span style=\"color: #F59E0B\">{{s.unit}}</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3D5873; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.45\">{{s.label}}</div>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- AI BAND --><div data-notr=\"\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg,#FFF4D6,#EAF3FC); border-top: 1px solid #F5D58A\"><div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 22px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 28px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px); color: #0B2A4A\">始于 1968 年的经验。 <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">AI 的速度。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3D5873; flex: 1 1 300px\">AI 负责速度，持证报关员负责判断。</div><a href=\"how-we-use-ai.html\" style=\"background: #0B2A4A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap\">了解我们如何使用 AI →</a></div></div>\n<!-- LOAD PLANNER FEATURE -->\n<div style=\"background: #0B2A4A; color: #FFFFFF; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px 56px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px\"><span style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px\">NEW · FREE TOOL</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #9CC7EE\">NO SIGN-UP</span></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.8vw, 70px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 20px\">How many containers? <span style=\"color: #FFC93C\">Where does every carton go?</span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #CFE3F5; margin: 0 0 26px; max-width: 600px\">Our 3D container load planner answers both in under a minute. Upload your packing list and it picks the best mix of 20′, 40′ and 40′ HC, then shows you how to load it, row by row.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 10px 20px; margin-bottom: 32px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{lpPoints}}\" as=\"x\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #FFFFFF\"><span style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800\">✓</span><span>{{x}}</span></div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a href=\"container-load-planner.html\" style=\"background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; text-decoration: none\">Plan my container free →</a>\n<a href=\"container-load-planner.html#\" style=\"background: transparent; color: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #3B6A96; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">See a sample load in 3D</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"background: #F2F6FB; border-radius: 28px; padding: 10px; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); position: relative\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"load-planner-loop-poster.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 20px\" aria-label=\"A 40 foot container being filled with coloured cartons row by row in the 3D load planner\">\n<source src=\"load-planner-loop.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 24px; bottom: 22px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(11,42,74,0.18); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #0A6CC2; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">RESULT</span><br><b style=\"font-size: 16px\">2 × 40′ High Cube</b> · 87% full</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CUSTOMS ENGINE -->\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 32px 104px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1.1 1 520px; min-width: 0; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: #DCEEFC\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"customs-poster.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block\" aria-label=\"Bright office overlooking a sunny container port, with shipping documents on the desk\">\n<source src=\"customs.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">CUSTOMS BROKER · LICENCE R-7/92</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 64px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 20px\">Customs is our engine. Freight runs on it.</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0 0 24px\">Most forwarders hand clearance to someone else. We hold the licence ourselves, so classification, duty and permissions are settled before your cargo sails, not argued over after it lands.</p>\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"customs-brokerage.html\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 15px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Customs brokerage →</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOLUTIONS -->\n<div id=\"solutions\" style=\"background: #F2F8FD\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 32px 100px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 64px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 48px\">\n<h2 style=\"flex: 1 1 620px; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Every way cargo enters and leaves India.</h2>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">Eighteen solutions, one desk, one licence. Because we clear what we carry, nothing falls between a forwarder and a broker.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{solutions}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"18\">\n<a class=\"card\" href=\"#\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 26px; text-decoration: none; color: #0B2A4A; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 210px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #5E7891; letter-spacing: 0.1em\">{{s.group}}</span>\n<span style=\"{{s.flagStyle}}\">{{s.flag}}</span>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 108%; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.1\">{{s.title}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3D5873\">{{s.body}}</span>\n<span style=\"margin-top: auto; color: #0A6CC2; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px\">Learn more →</span>\n</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- MOBILE PHONE EXPORTS -->\n<div id=\"mobile\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFC93C; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 24px\">SPECIALIST DESK · MUMBAI AIRPORT</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 76px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 24px\">Mumbai airport's #1 customs broker for mobile phone exports.</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0 0 14px; max-width: 600px\">India shipped about $29.4 billion of smartphones in FY26, and the flights out don't wait. Our 24×7 desk inside Sahar Air Cargo handles the battery paperwork, IMEI lists and airline handover, so your phones make tonight's flight.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; margin: 0 0 30px\">Handled by YAM at Mumbai airport, FY 2025-26: 2.4 million+ handsets · 807 tonnes of phones · 1,076 tonnes of air cargo in all</p>\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"mobile-phone-exports.html\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Mobile export desk →</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; background: #BFE5FF; position: relative\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"bom-poster.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block\" aria-label=\"Cargo freighter with nose door open being loaded on a sunny airport apron\">\n<source src=\"bom-freighter.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<span style=\"position: absolute; left: 16px; bottom: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\"><span style=\"color: #1F8A4C\">●</span> Sahar Air Cargo desk · open 24×7</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{phonePoints}}\" as=\"p\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<div style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #0A6CC2; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px\">{{p.k}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35\">{{p.t}}</div>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- THIRD COUNTRY -->\n<div id=\"third\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #E6F4FF 0%, #FFFFFF 100%)\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 64px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 48px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 640px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 18px\">THIRD-COUNTRY TRADE · RE-EXPORT IN BOND</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 76px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Buy anywhere. Hold in India. Sell anywhere. <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">Pay no Indian duty.</span></h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">Import into a customs-bonded warehouse or FTWZ, store or repack, then re-export to a buyer in another country without paying Indian import duty. Few forwarders run this end to end. It's one of our specialities.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 21 / 8; background: #DCEEFC; margin-bottom: 16px; position: relative\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"warehouse-inout-poster.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block\" aria-label=\"Forklift carries a pallet from an arriving blue container, through a fenced bonded zone, into an orange export container\">\n<source src=\"warehouse-inout.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<span style=\"position: absolute; left: 18px; bottom: 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">Held in bond in India · zero import duty</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{flow}}\" as=\"f\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n<div style=\"{{f.style}}\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: {{f.kc}}\">{{f.k}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 108%; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.1\">{{f.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: {{f.bc}}\">{{f.b}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- LATAM CORRIDOR -->\n<div id=\"corridor\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #2FA6B8; min-height: 640px; display: flex; align-items: center\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"rio-poster.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 45%\" aria-label=\"Container ship sailing into Guanabara Bay, Rio de Janeiro, with Sugarloaf Mountain behind\">\n<source src=\"rio.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1400px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 560px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94); border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(11,42,74,0.2)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">SIGNATURE CORRIDOR</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px\">India <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">⇄</span> Latin America</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0 0 14px\">Most Indian forwarders look to the Gulf. We look further. Our director studied and worked in Brazil at Fundação Getulio Vargas, so we know how trade really moves through Santos, Rio, Buenos Aires and Georgetown.</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #0B2A4A; margin: 0 0 22px\">Hablamos español · Falamos português</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Brazil</span>\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Argentina</span>\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Guyana</span>\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Colombia</span>\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Chile</span>\n<span style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px\">Mexico</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- TOOLS -->\n<div id=\"tools\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 64px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 44px\">\n<h2 style=\"flex: 1 1 620px; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">Free tools traders bookmark.</h2>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">The reason people come back every week, and the reason Google sends them to us in the first place.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{tools}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"8\">\n<a class=\"card\" href=\"#\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; text-decoration: none; color: #0B2A4A; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: start\">\n<span style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFF4D6; color: #B45309; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">{{t.icon}}</span>\n<span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; min-width: 0\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px\">{{t.t}}</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #5E7891\">{{t.b}}</span></span>\n</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- MOMENTS THAT MATTER -->\n<div id=\"stories\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 64px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 44px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 620px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 14px\">MOMENTS THAT MATTER</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">When everyone saw two choices, we found a third.</h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 0\">Four jobs from our files. Each one had a deadline, a reputation or a life riding on it.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{stories}}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 24px; padding: 30px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; color: #0A6CC2\">{{s.big}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.15\">{{s.t}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D5873\">{{s.b}}</span>\n<span style=\"margin-top: auto; display: inline-block; align-self: flex-start; background: #FFF4D6; color: #6B4A00; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600\">{{s.tag}}</span>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- TRADE DESK -->\n<div id=\"desk\" style=\"background: #F2F8FD\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 32px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 44px\">\n<div style=\"min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2; margin-bottom: 16px\"><span class=\"live\">●</span> TRADE DESK · EVERY WEEKDAY</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0\">First to the news. First to what it means.</h2>\n</div>\n<a href=\"trade-desk.html\" style=\"font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid #0A6CC2; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 22px\">All briefings →</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{briefs}}\" as=\"b\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\">\n<a class=\"card\" href=\"trade-desk.html\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: #0B2A4A; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #DCEEFC; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #5E7891\">[briefing photo]</span></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #0A6CC2; letter-spacing: 0.06em\">{{b.tag}} · {{b.date}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 104%; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.2\">{{b.title}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D5873\">{{b.dek}}</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ABOUT -->\n<div id=\"about\" style=\"background: #FFC93C\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 72px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 600px; min-width: 0\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #6B4A00; margin-bottom: 14px\">COMMITTED TO COMMITMENTS · SINCE 1968</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(44px, 5.6vw, 84px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 22px; color: #0B2A4A\">The places changed. The promise never did.</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 26px; max-width: 600px; color: #3B2A05\">The family group began in 1962 as Pacific Travels, in a small office on Mall Road, Kanpur, with a belief that a person's word should always mean something. In 1968 we went into shipping, and we've been moving India's trade ever since. Today we're a licensed customs broker (R-7/92, lifetime validity) with desks in Delhi, Mumbai and Mundra, and some of our clients have been with us for generations.</p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px 28px; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 26px\">\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: 104%; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #0B2A4A\">“For us, every shipment is important. Every relationship is priceless.”</p>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #3B2A05\"><strong>Razi Zaheer</strong> · Managing Director, second generation</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"YAM-Logistics-Corporate-Profile.pdf\" download=\"YAM-Logistics-Corporate-Profile.pdf\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #0B2A4A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">↓ Download our company profile <span style=\"font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.75; font-size: 14px\">PDF · 4.8 MB</span></a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{timeline}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"8\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; color: #0B2A4A\">{{t.year}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-top: 6px; color: #3B2A05; font-weight: 600\">{{t.title}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; margin-top: 2px; color: #5A4310\">{{t.sub}}</div>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #2FA6B8\">\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"cta-poster.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 40%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<source src=\"cta-ship.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<div style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 140px 32px; display: flex; justify-content: center\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.93); border-radius: 32px; padding: 56px 48px; text-align: center; max-width: 980px; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(11,42,74,0.25)\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(40px, 5.4vw, 84px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin: 0 auto 28px\">Tell us what's moving. <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">We'll set sail.</span></h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center\">\n<a class=\"go\" href=\"contact.html\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 18px 32px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Get a quote →</a>\n<a class=\"sun\" href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"background: #25D366; color: #06331A; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">WhatsApp a broker</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n"}